/* Setup guide */
"Requirements" = "运行要求";
"JIT Compilation" = "JIT 编译";
"Required for x86 code translation. On iOS 26, StikDebug must stay attached — assign the 'universal' or 'MeloNX' JIT script to Madeira in StikDebug." = "用于转换 x86 代码。在 iOS 26 上，StikDebug 必须保持连接——请在 StikDebug 中为 Madeira 指定“universal”或“MeloNX”JIT 脚本。";
"Increased Memory Limit" = "提高内存限制";
"Raises the Jetsam memory threshold. Included in the app entitlements. If not detected, use GetMoreRam to inject it." = "提高 Jetsam 内存阈值。应用权限中已包含此项；如果未检测到，请使用 GetMoreRam 注入。";
"Extended Virtual Addressing" = "扩展虚拟地址空间";
"Expands virtual address space to ~64GB. Required for large games. Must be injected via GetMoreRam (free accounts can't provision this)." = "将虚拟地址空间扩展至约 64 GB，大型游戏需要此项。必须通过 GetMoreRam 注入（免费账户无法配置此权限）。";
"Setup Steps" = "设置步骤";
"Install Madeira via SideStore or Xcode" = "通过 SideStore 或 Xcode 安装 Madeira";
"Install GetMoreRam and run it to inject memory entitlements into your App ID" = "安装并运行 GetMoreRam，为你的 App ID 注入内存权限";
"Reinstall Madeira with the same IPA to apply injected entitlements" = "使用同一 IPA 重新安装 Madeira，使注入的权限生效";
"In StikDebug, assign the 'universal' JIT script to Madeira and launch it" = "在 StikDebug 中为 Madeira 指定“universal”JIT 脚本并启动";
"Launch Madeira and tap 'Test JIT' to verify" = "启动 Madeira，然后轻点“测试 JIT”进行验证";
"About" = "关于";
"Madeira is a proof-of-concept for running x86 Windows games on iOS using FEX-Emu, Wine, and Metal-based graphics translation." = "Madeira 是一个概念验证项目，通过 FEX-Emu、Wine 和基于 Metal 的图形转换在 iOS 上运行 x86 Windows 游戏。";
"Setup Guide" = "设置指南";
"Done" = "完成";

